# Benchmark run artefacts — never committed. Two trees since the lead's ruling of
# 2026-09-04: `runs/` is what a workflow may see, `truth_store/` is the hidden truth.
# Anchored to the repository root: an unanchored `runs/` also matches `configs/runs/`,
# which holds the run harness's frozen settings and MUST be committed.
/runs/
/truth_store/

# Real-data anchor (proposal §8): raw downloads are reproduced by `python -m anchor.fetch`
# from anchor/MANIFEST.json. Everything under anchor/raw/ is ignored except the few files
# under 1 MB whose licence permits redistribution (listed explicitly below).
anchor/raw/**
!anchor/raw/*/
!anchor/raw/iowa-muscatine-wrrf/ATTRIBUTION.md
!anchor/raw/iowa-muscatine-wrrf/README.txt
!anchor/raw/iowa-muscatine-wrrf/LABS-raw.csv
!anchor/raw/iowa-muscatine-wrrf/LABS-data-dictionary.csv
!anchor/raw/iowa-muscatine-wrrf/SCADA-data-dictionary.csv

